{{Classic Era}}
The Mountains of Rathe is a vast and dangerous mid level zone. It lies along the southern route from Freeport to Qeynos. The high peaks hide away many separate areas within the zone, each with its own dangers and things to discover. Rathe Mountains can be a confusing place to travel through, and aside from those hunting the powerful Hill Giants there often aren't many fellow adventures around.

